# Shutter Spot brand naming

For the Neo Digital client **Shutter Spot** (`shutterspot.com`, Integrations property name **Shutter Spot**, Google Ads customer ID 745-406-1453):

- Use exactly **Shutter Spot** in client-facing copy, titles, meta, headings, FAQs, schema, and reports.
- Do **not** use **Blind Spot** or **blind spot**. That string is the Google Ads MCC sub-account label only, not the public brand.
- Do not rename, normalize, or post-process the business name. Do not infer a different name from other blind/window clients in the portfolio (for example Superior Blinds).

When editing master instructions or generation prompts for this property, preserve the Integrations name **Shutter Spot** as the canonical public name.
